═══ context generate ═══
putnami context generate

Regenerate the Putnami guidance block in CLAUDE.md and AGENTS.md, and the agent skills the workspace declares by in-tree path. Bytes outside the block are never touched; an edited block is preserved and reported, and --force rewrites that block only. No other file is written: run `putnami mcp install` to register the MCP server

Usage:
  putnami context generate [--force]

Command Flags:
  --force                      Rewrite a guidance block that was edited or written by an older release

Examples:
  putnami context generate
  putnami context generate --force

Global Options:
  Common: --verbose, --debug, --help
  Project Selection: --all, --impacted, --projects, --tag, --exclude-tag, --baseline
  Execution: --credential-fd, --no-cache
  Output: --output, --json, --quiet, --color, --no-color

Related Commands:
