═══ context map ═══
putnami context map

Print the workspace orientation map, built in memory from committed artifacts (project manifests, schema/openapi.json, schema/config.jsonschema.json, READMEs, and the workspace docs tree): Markdown by default, and with --output=json the map document as data, the same document the MCP workspace_map tool serves. --projects and --impacted narrow the printed projects. Byte-deterministic on an unchanged tree. It writes no file, and a build writes no map

Usage:
  putnami context map [--projects <list>] [--impacted] [--output <format>]

